=== layout: one-panel

# Terms

@body

- Nucleobase - Purine or Pyrimidine
- Nucleoside - Base + Sugar
- Nucleotide - Base + Sugar + Phosphate
- Polynucleotide - More than one nucleotides in a chain
- Nucleic acids - All of the above

